.Dd May 18, 2026
.Dt MACOSWHEELS 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm macoswheels
.Nd macOS driver for Thrustmaster and Logitech racing wheels
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a DriverKit System Extension
.Pq DEXT
plus a userland CLI that lets Thrustmaster T-series and Logitech G-series
racing wheels work on macOS 26 and later.
.Pp
The DEXT claims the wheel over USB, sends the proprietary initialization
sequence
.Po
boot-mode to firmware-mode switch on Thrustmaster T-series, HID++
.Cm 0xF8/0x09
native-mode switch on Logitech DFP / DFGT / G25 / G27 / G29
.Pc ,
reads the wheel's own HID Report Descriptor and re-publishes it with a
USB PID 1.0 force-feedback output block spliced in.
Games that talk to
.Xr IOHIDManager 7 ,
including CrossOver / Wine titles, see a standard force-feedback joystick
with no per-app configuration.
.Sh SUPPORTED DEVICES
.Bl -tag -width "Thrustmaster T-GT (firmware mode)"
.It Thrustmaster T150
VID 0x044F, boot PID 0xB65D, firmware PID 0xB677. Full FFB encoder.
.It Thrustmaster T300 RS, TX, TS-XW, TS-PC, T248, T-GT
T-series family sharing the T300 protocol; full FFB encoder.
.It Thrustmaster T128
Recognised; steering / pedals / buttons / hat exposed via the dynamic
descriptor passthrough. FFB unimplemented (the wheel's wire protocol is
not publicly documented).
.It Thrustmaster TH8A shifter
Stand-alone H-pattern / sequential shifter.
.It Logitech DFP, DFGT, G25, G27
G-series family, behind a boot-to-native PID swap.
.It Logitech G29, G920, G923 (PC, PS, Xbox)
G-series family. G29 also reached via the boot-to-native PID swap.
.It Logitech Driving Force shifter
Stand-alone H-pattern shifter.
.El
.Sh DISTRIBUTION MODEL
.Nm
is dev-signed only.
To install,
.Xr csrutil 1
must be relaxed and
.Xr systemextensionsctl 1
must have developer mode enabled.
The project is not, and will not be, notarized; it is intended for personal
use by sim-racers willing to manage their own SIP posture.
